WEBVTT

00:08.300 --> 00:09.440
<b>The moon's pretty.</b>

00:10.050 --> 00:11.940
<b>Is that, like...</b>

00:12.340 --> 00:13.200
<b>...a confession?</b>

00:14.920 --> 00:18.430
<b>Sacchan, you're supposed to look at 
this person if you're confessing.</b>

00:18.430 --> 00:20.070
<b>R-Right, Hiro-kun?</b>

00:20.070 --> 00:21.770
<b>Otherwise it's like I'm...</b>

00:22.480 --> 00:23.120
<b>Huh?</b>

00:23.540 --> 00:25.070
<b>I'm confessing to both of you.</b>

00:25.600 --> 00:28.410
<b>I like Touko-chan,</b>

00:28.820 --> 00:29.960
<b>and I like Hiro-kun.</b>

00:32.290 --> 00:33.220
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:33.670 --> 00:35.870
<b>I finally said it.</b>

00:36.460 --> 00:38.300
<b>Thanks to Hiro-kun.</b>

00:38.930 --> 00:40.490
<b>And I could say it to you, too.</b>

00:40.490 --> 00:41.310
<b>Yeah,</b>

00:41.700 --> 00:43.980
<b>the moon's pretty today.</b>

00:43.980 --> 00:47.020
<b>Sacchan, I still don't get it.</b>

00:47.320 --> 00:51.320
<b>Touko-chan, let's stay good friends.</b>

00:53.310 --> 00:54.020
<b>Yeah,</b>

00:54.320 --> 00:56.050
<b>the moon's pretty today.</b>

02:32.460 --> 02:35.210
<b>Episode 10
"Jonathan"</b>

02:37.920 --> 02:40.290
<b>Sacchan seems so happy.</b>

02:40.590 --> 02:43.560
<b>Sacchan texts me every day.</b>

02:43.560 --> 02:44.560
<b>She does?</b>

02:45.480 --> 02:47.340
<b>Saying, "For tomorrow."</b>

02:47.340 --> 02:48.600
<b>For tomorrow?</b>

02:52.170 --> 02:53.450
<b>I'm home!</b>

02:54.360 --> 02:56.700
<b>I wonder what's for dinner today.</b>

02:56.700 --> 02:58.360
<b>Scooch, scooch.</b>

02:59.950 --> 03:02.170
<b>Yanagi-san was running today, too.</b>

03:03.000 --> 03:05.370
<b>Really? Yana-chan's really hanging in there.</b>

03:05.710 --> 03:08.660
<b>Hina, have you told Touko already?</b>

03:08.960 --> 03:09.640
<b>What?</b>

03:09.640 --> 03:12.160
<b>Wait until after dinner.</b>

03:13.580 --> 03:14.970
<b>Tada.</b>

03:15.570 --> 03:17.720
<b>It's so cute, Hina.</b>

03:17.720 --> 03:19.620
<b>Isn't it a bit too showy?</b>

03:19.620 --> 03:21.220
<b>Yana-chan gave you that?</b>

03:21.220 --> 03:23.970
<b>She told me Yukinari-san 
complimented her in it.</b>

03:23.970 --> 03:26.130
<b>I said I couldn't take it, but...</b>

03:26.890 --> 03:27.770
<b>Should I not have?</b>

03:27.770 --> 03:31.160
<b>No, it looks nice on you!</b>

03:31.160 --> 03:32.270
<b>Good for you.</b>

03:32.270 --> 03:33.350
<b>Right?!</b>

03:33.350 --> 03:34.710
<b>Can I say something?</b>

03:34.710 --> 03:36.100
<b>Here, coffee.</b>

03:37.290 --> 03:38.730
<b>Hina, when you're wearing that—</b>

03:38.730 --> 03:40.390
<b>Don't let it get cold.</b>

03:42.980 --> 03:46.240
<b>Onee-chan, Yanagi-san says she's 
going to change into someone new.</b>

03:53.120 --> 03:55.580
<b><i>Yana-chan sure is amazing.</i></b>

03:56.490 --> 03:58.480
<b><i>A new Yana-chan, huh?</i></b>

03:59.500 --> 04:00.770
<b><i>I want to meet her.</i></b>

04:04.830 --> 04:06.050
<b><i>I want to meet her...</i></b>

04:14.100 --> 04:16.610
<b>From: Sacchan
Subject: For tomorrow
"Tsuki wo Ageru Hito"</b>

04:48.870 --> 04:49.720
<b><i>"For tomorrow:"</i></b>

04:49.720 --> 04:56.730
<b>From: Hiro Shirasaki
Re: For Tomorrow
"Meijinden" is amazing. It makes me 
feel really small, or really big.
Looking forward to "Tsuki wo Ageru Hito"</b>

04:50.770 --> 04:52.250
<b><i>"Meijinden" is amazing.</i></b>

04:52.550 --> 04:54.270
<b><i>It makes me feel</i></b>

04:54.270 --> 04:56.730
<b><i>really small, or really big.</i></b>

04:57.800 --> 04:59.660
<b><i>Looking forward to "Tsuki wo Ageru Hito,"</i></b>

04:59.960 --> 05:00.730
<b><i>Hiro.</i></b>

05:25.510 --> 05:28.180
<b>I still can't hear it.</b>

05:29.040 --> 05:31.250
<b><i>You can't hear the fragments 
of the future anymore?</i></b>

05:31.720 --> 05:33.140
<b><i>But why?</i></b>

05:33.850 --> 05:35.540
<b><i>Is it because you met Touko?</i></b>

05:36.350 --> 05:39.100
<b><i>Maybe you don't need it anymore.</i></b>

06:06.130 --> 06:08.630
<b>Inbox
From: Yanagi
Subject: Hinode-hama today
Clear skies today. Hinode Bridge, futon.</b>

06:22.650 --> 06:24.480
<b>Inbox
From: Yanagi
Subject: Hinode-hama today
Sunny all day.
In front of the gelato store.
Blacks 1, Whites 2</b>

06:24.480 --> 06:26.520
<b><i>"Blacks 1, Whites 2," huh?</i></b>

06:29.240 --> 06:31.490
<b>Issen Ichibyou Monogatari</b>

06:34.240 --> 06:35.450
<b>Welcome.</b>

06:36.370 --> 06:37.230
<b>Hey.</b>

06:37.560 --> 06:38.630
<b>Your order?</b>

06:39.100 --> 06:40.010
<b>Oolong tea.</b>

06:40.310 --> 06:42.000
<b>We don't have any.</b>

06:43.420 --> 06:45.210
<b>Here's your blend.</b>

06:45.790 --> 06:48.770
<b>Hot coffee in mid-summer. 
You're totally a grown-up.</b>

06:49.140 --> 06:50.340
<b>Her name was</b>

06:51.150 --> 06:52.800
<b>Sachi Nagamiya, right?</b>

06:53.870 --> 06:56.880
<b>If you know where she lives, 
I want you to tell me.</b>

06:57.300 --> 07:00.550
<b>Uh, I can't tell you for nothing.</b>

07:00.550 --> 07:02.920
<b>Figures. What do you want to know?</b>

07:03.550 --> 07:06.840
<b>Do you like Touko-san?</b>

07:06.840 --> 07:08.550
<b>You better be treating her well.</b>

07:08.550 --> 07:11.490
<b>Touko-san's really important to us.</b>

07:15.520 --> 07:18.440
<b>I'll tell you where Sacchan lives.</b>

07:19.020 --> 07:22.830
<b>I haven't answered anything 
you wanted to ask.</b>

07:23.260 --> 07:27.010
<b>I can't really find the words,</b>

07:27.830 --> 07:29.140
<b>but you don't have to answer me.</b>

07:41.280 --> 07:44.240
<b><i>Clear skies today again. The sky is high.</i></b>

08:11.840 --> 08:12.900
<b>Hello.</b>

08:18.660 --> 08:20.340
<b>I heard from Hiro Shirasaki.</b>

08:21.000 --> 08:21.850
<b>Oh.</b>

08:34.350 --> 08:37.280
<b>Why did the 5:30 guy become a girl?</b>

08:38.290 --> 08:39.320
<b>Boring.</b>

08:39.320 --> 08:41.850
<b>You know something about this, don't you?</b>

08:41.850 --> 08:43.660
<b>Hey, tell us.</b>

08:44.850 --> 08:47.490
<b>That's my 5:30 girl.</b>

09:01.040 --> 09:04.170
<b>Can you tell me about the shiny things?</b>

09:04.520 --> 09:07.260
<b>Yanagi-chan heard the other day.</b>

09:07.260 --> 09:08.290
<b>I see.</b>

09:08.840 --> 09:12.220
<b>You aren't taking care
 of Touko-chan at all.</b>

09:12.660 --> 09:13.590
<b>I guess not.</b>

09:14.070 --> 09:15.450
<b>Takayama said that to me, too.</b>

09:16.300 --> 09:19.580
<b>But does Fukami Touko
want to be taken care of?</b>

09:20.630 --> 09:23.110
<b>She makes me feel at home.</b>

09:23.610 --> 09:24.330
<b>I—</b>

09:25.340 --> 09:27.770
<b>Is it okay if she helps me?</b>

09:29.130 --> 09:32.690
<b>I think she's helping me, too.</b>

09:33.430 --> 09:36.390
<b>I don't think I know more than</b>

09:36.390 --> 09:39.180
<b>you do about the shiny thing.</b>

09:41.560 --> 09:42.520
<b>Do you</b>

09:43.350 --> 09:45.560
<b>like Touko-chan?</b>

10:15.690 --> 10:16.590
<b>She's—</b>

10:17.130 --> 10:18.190
<b>no way.</b>

10:36.050 --> 10:37.140
<b>Hello?</b>

10:37.640 --> 10:38.400
<b>Oh.</b>

10:38.770 --> 10:40.120
<b>I—</b>

10:40.450 --> 10:42.740
<b>Are you the one who called 
Kakeru the other day?</b>

10:43.040 --> 10:43.750
<b>Yes.</b>

10:44.400 --> 10:45.290
<b>So cute.</b>

10:46.730 --> 10:49.290
<b>Forgive me, but what's your name?</b>

10:49.580 --> 10:51.350
<b>My name's Touko Fukami.</b>

10:51.350 --> 10:53.500
<b>Is Kakeru-kun home?</b>

10:53.880 --> 10:56.060
<b>Unfortunately, he's not home right now.</b>

10:56.060 --> 10:58.530
<b>Oh, I'll be leaving then.</b>

10:59.200 --> 11:01.430
<b>Since you're here, why not have 
a cup of tea or something?</b>

11:02.710 --> 11:04.400
<b>Would you like to talk for a bit?</b>

11:04.400 --> 11:05.570
<b>Umm...</b>

11:05.570 --> 11:06.280
<b>Okay?</b>

11:11.360 --> 11:13.070
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

11:13.070 --> 11:13.690
<b>Not at all.</b>

11:17.380 --> 11:18.780
<b>He's a strange kid, isn't he?</b>

11:19.410 --> 11:20.970
<b>Yes, very.</b>

11:20.970 --> 11:22.660
<b>I mean, a little!</b>

11:23.510 --> 11:24.750
<b>Sorry.</b>

11:25.310 --> 11:27.830
<b>I think it's my fault.</b>

11:28.140 --> 11:31.140
<b>No, I'm quite guilty, too.</b>

11:31.140 --> 11:32.300
<b>Eh? Huh?</b>

11:32.300 --> 11:34.060
<b>Can you move over a little bit?</b>

11:34.360 --> 11:35.760
<b>You'll spill it.</b>

11:54.000 --> 11:54.740
<b>It</b>

11:55.470 --> 11:57.360
<b>doesn't work when I'm alone.</b>

11:57.730 --> 12:00.110
<b>You know what I hate the most?</b>

12:00.110 --> 12:02.150
<b>Washing Japanese mustard spinach</b>

12:02.150 --> 12:04.650
<b>in the winter.</b>

12:04.650 --> 12:07.320
<b>You've never done that, have you?</b>

12:07.620 --> 12:08.890
<b>A long time ago.</b>

12:09.810 --> 12:12.030
<b>Kakeru doesn't have
a place to to call home.</b>

12:12.870 --> 12:15.940
<b>I've been dragging him around 
ever since he was little.</b>

12:16.490 --> 12:20.210
<b>We've only ever been in the same 
place for two years at most.</b>

12:20.460 --> 12:24.120
<b>He was quick to make friends, 
when he was little.</b>

12:24.530 --> 12:27.180
<b>But as soon as there's 
a festival or something,</b>

12:27.180 --> 12:30.220
<b>all the kids go into festival mode,</b>

12:30.220 --> 12:32.950
<b>and they forget about Kakeru.</b>

12:32.950 --> 12:36.100
<b>He had a phrase for it.</b>

12:36.100 --> 12:38.110
<b>"A sudden, expected loneliness."</b>

12:38.110 --> 12:39.840
<b>Right, that's it.</b>

12:39.840 --> 12:41.350
<b>I'm surprised you remember that.</b>

12:41.350 --> 12:43.000
<b>It was my fault, after all.</b>

13:13.910 --> 13:14.640
<b>Welcome home.</b>

13:19.150 --> 13:20.150
<b>Thanks.</b>

13:20.740 --> 13:25.150
<b>You've been running the same 
route while I was gone?</b>

13:25.450 --> 13:26.110
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:27.820 --> 13:28.630
<b>Ah.</b>

13:29.980 --> 13:31.280
<b>The seaside road is nice and windy.</b>

13:32.250 --> 13:35.340
<b>It helps you recover, doesn't it?</b>

13:36.230 --> 13:36.790
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:37.550 --> 13:40.150
<b>Was the grandpa there at the snack shop today?</b>

13:40.150 --> 13:41.050
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:41.560 --> 13:43.210
<b>That last uphill part,</b>

13:43.510 --> 13:47.010
<b>it's not even that bad, 
but it's tough, isn't it?</b>

13:51.520 --> 13:52.220
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:53.630 --> 13:54.440
<b>Yuki.</b>

13:55.900 --> 13:56.790
<b>Welcome home.</b>

14:03.870 --> 14:04.740
<b>Glad to be home.</b>

14:26.670 --> 14:29.980
<b>Oh, yeah? So you were
quite a bookworm.</b>

14:30.390 --> 14:34.260
<b>Back in the old days, everyone 
read maybe twenty books a year.</b>

14:34.560 --> 14:36.680
<b>Actually, we were being forced to read.</b>

14:36.680 --> 14:38.810
<b>So you couldn't really call me a bookworm.</b>

14:39.290 --> 14:42.630
<b>So is your boyfriend being discharged?</b>

14:42.630 --> 14:45.740
<b>Yep, he can go back to work, too.</b>

14:45.740 --> 14:46.870
<b>Congratulations.</b>

14:46.870 --> 14:49.500
<b>Oh, man, good for you, Nee-chan.</b>

14:49.500 --> 14:52.560
<b>So I want to invite him here sometime soon.</b>

14:52.560 --> 14:54.080
<b>That's perfectly fine.</b>

14:54.080 --> 14:56.080
<b>You should tell Dad.</b>

14:56.320 --> 14:59.210
<b>No, for coffee. Just coffee.</b>

14:59.700 --> 15:01.910
<b>He's coming just to drink coffee?</b>

15:01.910 --> 15:05.840
<b>Yeah, he said he couldn't 
have coffee in the hospital.</b>

15:05.840 --> 15:07.490
<b>He really missed it.</b>

15:07.490 --> 15:08.380
<b>Oh. Fine.</b>

15:08.630 --> 15:10.190
<b>So that's that.</b>

15:10.480 --> 15:11.840
<b>Tee hee.</b>

15:39.470 --> 15:42.790
<b><i>This is the town I grew up in.</i></b>

16:07.290 --> 16:10.450
<b><i>This is what Kakeru never had,</i></b>

16:10.450 --> 16:11.850
<b><i>a backdrop to my life.</i></b>

16:31.970 --> 16:32.930
<b>Short-stop!</b>

16:38.410 --> 16:39.750
<b><i>What do I do here?</i></b>

16:49.340 --> 16:51.200
<b><i>They were such a pain,</i></b>

16:51.550 --> 16:54.370
<b><i>but now that I can't hear 
them, it's a bit lonely.</i></b>

16:57.880 --> 16:59.180
<b><i>Touko Fukami,</i></b>

17:00.260 --> 17:01.660
<b><i>I miss you.</i></b>

17:10.940 --> 17:12.700
<b>You're running again 
starting tomorrow, right?</b>

17:12.700 --> 17:13.260
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:31.320 --> 17:32.110
<b><i>Snow?</i></b>

17:43.470 --> 17:44.400
<b><i>Again.</i></b>

17:55.490 --> 17:56.640
<b><i>I'm not scared.</i></b>

17:57.110 --> 17:59.140
<b><i>Because this is my place.</i></b>

18:00.140 --> 18:02.620
<b><i>I want to know about Kakeru-kun's</i></b>

18:02.620 --> 18:04.900
<b><i>"sudden, expected loneliness."</i></b>

18:05.550 --> 18:07.140
<b><i>I want to know more.</i></b>

18:10.950 --> 18:11.650
<b>Jonathan.</b>

18:12.550 --> 18:15.190
<b>Are you Kakeru-kun?</b>

18:17.310 --> 18:17.910
<b>No.</b>

18:18.520 --> 18:19.910
<b>You're not Jonathan!</b>

18:20.280 --> 18:20.660
<b>Wait.</b>

18:21.430 --> 18:24.380
<b>One, two, three...</b>

18:25.160 --> 18:26.340
<b>They're missing.</b>

18:26.960 --> 18:28.500
<b>One's missing.</b>

18:52.090 --> 18:53.730
<b><i>I have to find Jonathan.</i></b>

18:54.710 --> 18:57.190
<b><i>I'm not taking care of him at all.</i></b>

19:06.040 --> 19:06.970
<b>Jonathan.</b>

19:13.470 --> 19:13.880
<b>Wait.</b>

19:27.390 --> 19:28.600
<b>Kakeru-kun.</b>

19:43.050 --> 19:45.620
<b>Kakeru-kun, you came here, too.</b>

19:46.140 --> 19:47.230
<b>I thought here I might</b>

19:47.530 --> 19:51.650
<b>find out why I can't hear the 
fragments of the future anymore.</b>

19:52.330 --> 19:53.170
<b>Oh.</b>

19:54.390 --> 19:56.000
<b>Isn't that why you're here, too?</b>

19:56.860 --> 19:57.990
<b>I want to learn</b>

19:58.850 --> 20:02.050
<b>about your "sudden, expected loneliness."</b>

20:03.480 --> 20:04.260
<b>That's—</b>

20:04.560 --> 20:05.920
<b>I heard from your parents.</b>

20:06.500 --> 20:09.430
<b>Can you see the snow outside 
the window, Kakeru-kun?</b>

20:09.990 --> 20:11.550
<b>It's snowing?</b>

20:11.550 --> 20:14.190
<b>Yes. The whole time.</b>

20:14.670 --> 20:18.400
<b>It's snowing a lot, and I'm inside it.</b>

20:18.880 --> 20:22.030
<b>It's not a fragment. It's snowing all over.</b>

20:22.350 --> 20:23.860
<b>Touko, calm down.</b>

20:24.950 --> 20:26.710
<b>It's fine. I'm okay.</b>

20:27.010 --> 20:28.020
<b>I'm not scared.</b>

20:28.550 --> 20:30.420
<b>But that's not all!</b>

20:30.420 --> 20:31.420
<b>That's not?</b>

20:32.250 --> 20:33.430
<b>Kakeru-kun,</b>

20:34.180 --> 20:36.640
<b>in the snow, you—</b>

20:38.840 --> 20:39.460
<b>What?</b>

20:40.290 --> 20:41.300
<b>Um...</b>

20:45.070 --> 20:45.930
<b>Kakeru-kun... You kiss me.</b>

20:47.700 --> 20:51.310
<b>You kiss me.</b>

20:52.770 --> 20:54.290
<b>I think I'm messed up.</b>

20:54.290 --> 20:56.770
<b>I saw it before, too. 
That was the second time.</b>

20:57.140 --> 20:59.480
<b>What's wrong with me? Right?</b>

20:59.480 --> 21:02.520
<b>You said before that what we're seeing</b>

21:02.520 --> 21:04.990
<b>might not be the future.</b>

21:05.330 --> 21:06.320
<b>Then what?</b>

21:06.620 --> 21:08.540
<b>What is it that I'm seeing?</b>

21:10.010 --> 21:11.000
<b>Or will</b>

21:12.040 --> 21:13.320
<b>that time</b>

21:14.190 --> 21:15.120
<b>come to be?</b>

21:16.080 --> 21:19.550
<b>True, what we've been seeing and hearing</b>

21:19.550 --> 21:21.380
<b>might not have been the future.</b>

21:22.320 --> 21:25.980
<b>But the view you're seeing
outside the window is winter.</b>

21:26.970 --> 21:30.380
<b>There's no mistake that we 
heard and saw <i>something</i>.</b>

21:31.580 --> 21:32.570
<b>You're right.</b>

21:33.570 --> 21:36.740
<b>We have to accept that something is there.</b>

21:41.800 --> 21:42.500
<b>Yeah,</b>

21:42.900 --> 21:46.910
<b>and if we do this, it'll make 
it a fragment of the future.</b>

23:29.660 --> 23:31.720
<b>Kakeru-kun, what are you talking about?</b>

23:31.720 --> 23:34.390
<b>We were together all day yesterday.</b>

23:34.390 --> 23:37.560
<b>That means the two of us are going to see 
the fireworks together again next year, right?</b>

23:37.560 --> 23:39.180
<b>Onee-chan, oh, no!</b>

23:37.560 --> 23:39.180
<b>Episode 11
"Piano"</b>
